                <head>276. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>Between 4:04 and 4:24 p.m. on March 22, President Eisenhower, Secretary Dulles,
                    and General Goodpaster met with Prime Minister Macmillan, Foreign Secretary
                    Lloyd, and Patrick Dean. (Eisenhower Library, President’s Appointment Book) No
                    record of this conversation has been found in Department of State files.</p>
            </div>
